		IMPL "tests/cli/test_adapter.py::class BrigadeAdapterParseResultTest(AdapterTestCase)"
	SPEC "the Claude Code adapter maps capabilities to tool grants, the reasoning level to a model"
		+ "and an effort, passes the role package as an appended system prompt, caps the turns at"
		+ "the budget plus a quarter, and normalises the result object into outcome, steps, usage,"
		+ "session id, duration and error class, a rate limit classified and its reset hour parsed"
		+ "when named"
