		+ "lifted, tail -f of journal.jsonl printing raw JSON records"
		REF @DECISION.ARunKeepsAJournalOfOneShortTimestampedRecordPerActionThatTheReaderTails
	RATIONALE "the follow is a command of its own: an interrupt stops the follow, never the run,"
		+ "and leaves no failure to report, so it exits 0 as DESC 7 of"
		+ "@DECISION.EveryCommandReturnsOneDocumentRenderedOnceAndExitsByOneTable sets for a"
		+ "long-lived command; --json stays one document, which a script reads with runs show"
		+ "--json --log once the run has ended; the exit code at the end is that of"
		+ "brigade/commands/run.py, outcome done 0, any other 1"
