		+ "tarfile's data filter"
	STATUS implemented
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.F0
	COMPONENT "corpus"
	ROLE ada
	SPEC "brigade/corpus/prepare_tree.py extracts the archive of a commit under the data filter of"
		+ "tarfile and catches tarfile.FilterError, with no path extracting without the filter; the"
		+ "skip of tests/integration/corpus/test_prepare_tree.py on a tarfile without data_filter"
		+ "is removed"
		IMPL "brigade/corpus/prepare_tree.py::commit_tar.extractall(staged_tree, filter=\"data\")"
		IMPL "brigade/corpus/prepare_tree.py::except tarfile.FilterError as error:"
		IMPL "tests/integration/corpus/test_prepare_tree.py::class"
			+ "PrepareTreeOfACommitHoldingALinkOutsideItsTreeTest(PrepareTreeTestCase):"
	SPEC "under Python 3.11.3 brigade exits non-zero with the message brigade needs Python 3.11.4"
		+ "or later; this is Python 3.11.3, and brigade doctor reports the floor 3.11.4"
		IMPL "brigade/python_floor.py::PYTHON_FLOOR = (3, 11, 4)"
		IMPL "tests/unit/test_python_floor.py::((3, 11, 3), \"brigade needs Python 3.11.4 or later;"
			+ "this is Python 3.11.3\"),"
		IMPL "tests/cli/test_doctor.py::class"
			+ "BrigadeDoctorOnAMachineWithEveryItemTest(DoctorTestCase):"
	SPEC "the floor job of .github/workflows/ci.yml runs a Python below the floor, 3.11.3 where"
		+ "setup-python offers it on the runner, 3.10 as today otherwise, and fails unless the"
		+ "refusal names 3.11.4"
		IMPL ".github/workflows/ci.yml::python-version: \"3.11.3\""
		IMPL ".github/workflows/ci.yml::runs-on: ubuntu-24.04"
		IMPL ".github/workflows/ci.yml::grep -F \"Python 3.11.4 or later\" refusal.txt"
	SPEC "the floor reads 3.11.4 in the README, in AGENTS.md and in the titles of the decision"
		+ "PythonStandardLibraryOnly and the decision"
		+ "BrigadeInstallsFromOneFileWithFourPrerequisites, the rationale of the first naming the"
		+ "data filter beside tomllib"
		IMPL "README.md::brigade needs Python 3.11.4 or later and nothing outside its standard"
			+ "library."
		IMPL "AGENTS.md::Python 3.11.4 or later, standard library only"
		IMPL "corpus/decisions.awawa::TITLE \"brigade is Python 3.11.4 or later"
		IMPL "corpus/decisions.awawa::zipapp or a clone; Python 3.11.4 or later, git,"
		IMPL "corpus/decisions.awawa::3.11.4 the floor tarfile's data filter"
	RATIONALE "brigade/corpus/prepare_tree.py:29-30 at 9bed0a7 keeps two paths, DATA_EXTRACTION ="
		+ "{\"filter\": \"data\"} if hasattr(tarfile, \"data_filter\") else {} and MEMBER_REFUSAL ="
		+ "getattr(tarfile, \"FilterError\", ()): tarfile gained its data filter in 3.12,"
		+ "backported to 3.11.4 by PEP 706, so under 3.11.0 to 3.11.3 brigade extracts without the"
		+ "refusal @TASK.B68 delivers; the CI runs the latest 3.11 and the latest Python, never"
		+ "that branch, and the coverage of the whole suite under both misses no line of the file,"
		+ "each fallback holding on one line"
		REF @TASK.B68
	RATIONALE "the floor is stated by @DECISION.PythonStandardLibraryOnly and"
		+ "@DECISION.BrigadeInstallsFromOneFileWithFourPrerequisites, whose titles name it"
		REF @DECISION.PythonStandardLibraryOnly
		REF @DECISION.BrigadeInstallsFromOneFileWithFourPrerequisites
	RATIONALE "raising the floor removes the second path rather than testing it, as @TASK.B88 does"
		+ "for the arguments of brigade run; brigade/python_floor.py:3 holds the floor as a tuple"
		+ "that brigade/launcher.py:7 compares with three parts of sys.version_info, and doctor"
		+ "formats it, brigade/commands/doctor.py:59"
		REF @TASK.B88
	RATIONALE "the copies of the floor in artifact/ follow at the next republish of the Blueprint,"
